Z||000001||Cliff Pennock||07-10-2001||06:46 AM||||No, nothing wrong at all. I just checked and server load is at 5% at the moment. I'm also getting &lt;20ms pings to the server so there's also enough bandwidth left. Could you do a traceroute to the server? Just open a DOS-box and type:<P>  <FONT COLOR="red">tracert fiero.nl</FONT><P>If there any problems anywhere, that should show up in the traceroute.<BR>||||reg||1
